cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DeepSafe: A Multi-Modal Deepfake Detection Benchmark and Model Zoo"
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark results, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sah
    given-names: "Siddharth"
    email: "deepsafe.hq@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/deepsafehq/deepsafe-bench"
abstract: >-
  DeepSafe runs 24 deepfake detection and provenance models behind one
  interface and measures them across 411 generators and 6 robustness attacks.
  It reports in-distribution and held-out-generator performance separately,
  making generalization failure visible rather than hidden.
keywords:
  - deepfake-detection
  - benchmark
  - multimodal
  - model-zoo
  - generalization
